cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Seamtag: image annotation in LabelMe, Pascal VOC, YOLO and CreateML formats"
abstract: "Seamtag is a desktop app for Windows, macOS and Linux that labels images with polygons, rectangles, rotated boxes, circles, lines, points, a brush and eraser, and AI that outlines objects from a click, a box or words. It saves each image's labels beside it as LabelMe JSON, Pascal VOC, YOLO or CreateML, reviews a model's proposals, checks a whole folder's labels, and exports and imports COCO and Ultralytics YOLO datasets."
authors:
